      "principle": "Mere acquittal in a criminal case cannot be a ground to hold that the respondent was not subjected to cruelty.",
      "held": "The onus for proving the averments in the Criminal case are different from the Civil proceedings and mere acquittal cannot be a ground to hold that the respondent was not subjected to cruelty.",
